Treat each slot as two separate positions, giving 2·numSlots positions in total (at most 18). A bitmask over these positions records which ones are filled, so there are at most 2^18 states.

Define `dp[mask]` as the best AND sum after placing the first `popcount(mask)` numbers into exactly the positions in `mask`.

